.th LOGINFO I 5/31/77
.sh NAME
logname, logdir, logtty \*- information from login
.sh SYNOPSIS
.bd logname
.br
.bd logdir
.br
.bd logtty
.br
.sh DESCRIPTION
.it Logname
prints the user's login name.
.s3
.it Logdir
prints the login directory pathname.
.s3
.it Logtty
prints the single character tty letter (and never prints `x').
.s3
These data are created by
.it login\^\c
(I).
